OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FWednesday will start rather
OL,6,Fcloudy with some hill fog and patchy
OL,7,Fdrizzle. The cloud will lift and thin
OL,8,Fa little at times during the day,
OL,9,Fespecially in the south and east where
OL,10,Fbright intervals will develop. Feeling
OL,11,Fwarm and humid.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FEarly evening bright spells
OL,14,Fwill give way to thickening cloud from
OL,15,Fthe northwest through the evening,
OL,16,Fwith a few showers developing
OL,17,Fovernight. Clearer spells returning by
OL,18,Fthe morning.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
