OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FThursday will be a fresher
OL,6,Fday with a gentle northwesterly wind.
OL,7,FThere will be some pleasantly warm
OL,8,Fspells of sunshine, though the odd
OL,9,Flight shower cannot be ruled out.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FFriday
OL,12,Fand the weekend will hold onto a
OL,13,Ffresher feel. There will be a lot of
OL,14,Fdry weather with some sunny spells,
OL,15,Fthough one or two showers are also
OL,16,Fpossible.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
